   "text": "The capsule ejects the nose cone, as shown in Fig. 2.2.\nv\n7850m/s\nmass = 120kg\nmass = 720kg\nDetermine the velocity v of the capsule after the nose cone is ejected. Give your answer to\n3 significant figures.\nvelocity v of the capsule =  ......................................................... [3]",
